 * Measures the throughput of retrieving the last element from a {@link Flowable}
 * via the {@code FlowableLastMaybe} operator.
 *
 * The benchmark varies the size of the source {@code Flowable} to assess
 * scalability. Results are consumed by {@link Blackhole} to prevent dead‑code
 * elimination.
 */
@BenchmarkMode(Mode.Throughput)
@OutputTimeUnit(TimeUnit.SECONDS)
@Warmup(iterations = 5, time = 1, timeUnit = TimeUnit.SECONDS)
@Measurement(iterations = 5, time = 1, timeUnit = TimeUnit.SECONDS)
