 *
 * <p>Measures the throughput of flatMapping a {@code Maybe} into an {@code Observable}
 * and consuming all emitted items. The benchmark follows JMH best practices:
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Separate {@code @State} for immutable test data.</li>
 *   <li>Warm‑up and measurement iterations.</li>
 *   <li>Blackhole consumption to avoid dead‑code elimination.</li>
 *   <li>Throughput mode (operations per second).</li>
 * </ul>
 */
@BenchmarkMode(Mode.Throughput)
@OutputTimeUnit(TimeUnit.SECONDS)
